### DigitalTwin Portal — API examples (Checkpoint 3)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@supabaseUrl = https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
@userJwt = YOUR_SUPABASE_USER_JWT
@dtSecret = YOUR_DT_INTERNAL_WEBHOOK_SECRET
@chatId = YOUR_CHAT_UUID
@orgId = YOUR_ORG_UUID

### List agents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dt/agents?org={{orgId}}
Cookie: sb-access-token={{userJwt}}

### List chats
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dt/chats?org={{orgId}}&mode=default
Cookie: sb-access-token={{userJwt}}

### Create chat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dt/chats
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: sb-access-token={{userJwt}}

{
  "organisationId": "{{orgId}}",
  "agentId": "AGENT_UUID",
  "mode": "default"
}

### Send message (app → n8n when N8N_DT_CHAT_WEBHOOK set)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dt/chats/{{chatId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}

{
  "content": "Hallo, wer bist du?"
}

### Internal prompt build (n8n → app)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dt/internal/build-system-prompt
Content-Type: application/json
X-DT-Webhook-Secret: {{dtSecret}}

{
  "userId": "USER_UUID",
  "chatId": "{{chatId}}",
  "ghostMode": false
}

### n8n webhook dry-run (no Anthropic call)
POST https://sichtbarkeitsmeister.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/dt-chat?dryRun=true
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
X-DT-Source: nextjs-prod

{
  "chatId": "{{chatId}}",
  "organisationId": "{{orgId}}",
  "agentId": "AGENT_UUID",
  "mode": "default",
  "message": "Test",
  "userMessageId": null,
  "ghostMode": false
}

### Verify Supabase JWT (same check n8n uses)
GET {{supabaseUrl}}/auth/v1/user
Authorization: Bearer {{userJwt}}
apikey: YOUR_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY

### SEO monthly stats (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dt/seo/stats?org={{orgId}}
Cookie: sb-access-token={{userJwt}}

### Ingest monthly stats (n8n / internal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dt/internal/seo-monthly-stats
Content-Type: application/json
X-DT-Webhook-Secret: {{dtSecret}}

{
  "organisationId": "{{orgId}}",
  "periodMonth": "2026-04-01",
  "aiClicks": 42,
  "totalClicks": 1200,
  "impressions": 45000,
  "rankingsTop10": 18,
  "rankingsTop3": 5,
  "visibilityIndex": 12.4,
  "rawData": { "top_keywords": ["beispiel keyword", "seo beratung"] }
}
